   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why a separate LXC on Urd: Skuld already carries too much and freezes.\nLosing Hugin pauses collection until it returns; stored data survives in Patroni.\nSAML only works on hugin.xiiisins.com: the ACS URL is pinned to one host.",
   "originalText": "Why a separate LXC on Urd: Skuld already carries too much and freezes.\nLosing Hugin pauses collection until it returns; stored data survives in Patroni.\nSAML only works on hugin.xiiisins.com: the ACS URL is pinned to one host.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
